<title>MOROCCO: Morocco's fuel oil price reduced in April.</title>
<headline>Morocco's fuel oil price reduced in April.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's industrial fuel oil price has been set at 1,728.17 dirhams ($187) per tonne for April from 1,840.82 dirhams in March, Morocco's energy mimistry said late on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The price change is the result of a drop of oil prices on the international market in March,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Gas oil and kerosene fell respectively five and 18 cents to 5.02 dirhams and 3.33 dirhams a litre.</p>
<p>Pump prices for super and ordinary petrol remained unchanged at 7.65 and 7.42 dirhams a litre respectively.</p>
<p>($ = 9.2 dirhams)</p>
</text>
